config ONKYO_AVR_MANUFACTURER_CODE
	hex "Manufacturer code of the Onkyo AVR control cluster"
	default 0x1234
	help
	  Manufacturer code that identifies the vendor of the manufacturer
	  specific Onkyo AVR control cluster (0xFC00) and of everything the
	  cluster carries. Clients, such as a Home Assistant quirk or a
	  Zigbee2MQTT converter, address the cluster and its attributes with
	  this code, so they have to be configured with the same value.

	  The default is a placeholder. Set it to the manufacturer code that
	  the Connectivity Standards Alliance assigned to the vendor before
	  shipping a product that is based on this sample.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
